00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:21.870
Isso mesmo!

00:13:22.490 --> 00:13:24.290
Vou verificar no reino humano.

00:13:26.240 --> 00:13:27.300
Mantenha isso em segredo.

00:13:27.550 --> 00:13:28.010
Hum-hum.

00:13:28.390 --> 00:13:28.900
Hum-hum.

00:13:32.100 --> 00:13:33.320
Eu disse algo errado?

00:13:33.320 --> 00:13:33.840
Não.

00:13:34.360 --> 00:13:34.790
Certo?

00:13:34.790 --> 00:13:35.240
Sim.

00:13:39.550 --> 00:13:40.930
Essas criaturas

00:13:40.970 --> 00:13:42.960
